.TH batten-config-deprecations 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-config\-deprecations \- Report schema keys removed since a published release with no deprecation window
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten config deprecations\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIagainst\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report schema keys removed since a published release with no deprecation window
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIagainst\fR>
The git ref whose published schema is the baseline (e.g. v0.0.111)
